1
00:01:51,077 --> 00:01:58,077
Our new champions are the Straw Hat Pirates!

2
00:02:02,077 --> 00:02:04,077
Shelly!

3
00:02:11,077 --> 00:02:13,077
What a turn of events!

4
00:02:13,077 --> 00:02:16,077
The captain of the Straw Hats has chosen Shelly,

5
00:02:16,077 --> 00:02:18,077
a horse that Captain Foxy picked up on a whim

6
00:02:18,077 --> 00:02:20,077
after coming to this island.

7
00:02:20,077 --> 00:02:23,077
Is this pure genius or just plain ASE?

8
00:02:24,077 --> 00:02:26,077
There you go, Stiltskai.

9
00:02:26,077 --> 00:02:28,077
Now you have your horse back once and for all.

10
00:02:28,077 --> 00:02:29,077
How can I thank you?

11
00:02:29,077 --> 00:02:31,077
Seeing you together is thanks enough.

12
00:02:31,077 --> 00:02:33,077
This means so much.

13
00:02:33,077 --> 00:02:35,077
Really, thank you.

14
00:02:35,077 --> 00:02:38,077
Well, guess I can't blame him.

15
00:02:38,077 --> 00:02:41,077
Yeah, that is totally what I would have done.

16
00:02:41,077 --> 00:02:46,077
Good girl.

17
00:02:46,077 --> 00:02:49,077
I know you can take it.

18
00:02:49,077 --> 00:02:52,077
After all, you're a man, right?

19
00:02:53,077 --> 00:02:55,077
You bet I am!

20
00:02:55,077 --> 00:02:57,077
That's our Chopper.

21
00:02:57,077 --> 00:02:58,077
Leave it to me, little pal.

22
00:02:58,077 --> 00:02:59,077
You'll be just fine.

23
00:02:59,077 --> 00:03:02,077
If you're Chopper's last hope, he's screwed.

24
00:03:02,077 --> 00:03:04,077
I wonder what the next game's going to be.

25
00:03:04,077 --> 00:03:07,077
Whatever it is, I'm ready for it.

26
00:03:07,077 --> 00:03:10,077
We're going to have Chopper back in no time.

27
00:03:10,077 --> 00:03:15,077
Round three, the round and round roller race.

28
00:03:15,077 --> 00:03:25,077
Shelly, don't worry, girl.

29
00:03:25,077 --> 00:03:28,077
Our friends will be just fine.

30
00:03:28,077 --> 00:03:30,077
All we can do is cheer them on.

31
00:03:30,077 --> 00:03:34,077
Two fried squids and a sausage on a stick.

32
00:03:34,077 --> 00:03:35,077
You got it.

33
00:03:35,077 --> 00:03:36,077
Hey!

34
00:03:36,077 --> 00:03:39,077
We're still missing six support fellas over here!

35
00:03:39,077 --> 00:03:40,077
Hurry it up!

36
00:03:40,077 --> 00:03:42,077
Hey, where'd you guys put my tools?

37
00:03:42,077 --> 00:03:48,077
This next game sounds like fun, don't you think?

38
00:03:48,077 --> 00:03:49,077
Fun?

39
00:03:49,077 --> 00:03:51,077
That's kind of insensitive.

40
00:03:51,077 --> 00:03:53,077
Put yourself in Chopper's shoes for a second.

41
00:03:53,077 --> 00:03:54,077
Poor little guy.

42
00:03:54,077 --> 00:03:56,077
I didn't think of that.

43
00:03:56,077 --> 00:03:57,077
My apologies.

44
00:04:00,077 --> 00:04:03,077
Well, no big deal.

45
00:04:03,077 --> 00:04:07,077
It's these idiots that could use some sensitivity training.

46
00:04:07,077 --> 00:04:09,077
Hello!

47
00:04:09,077 --> 00:04:11,077
You're both so lovely!

48
00:04:11,077 --> 00:04:13,077
Are you ready for the magic?

49
00:04:13,077 --> 00:04:15,077
What are you eating now, Luffy?

50
00:04:15,077 --> 00:04:16,077
It's all kiwi.

51
00:04:16,077 --> 00:04:18,077
That old horse guy gave it to me.

52
00:04:18,077 --> 00:04:20,077
Actually tastes pretty good.

53
00:04:20,077 --> 00:04:24,077
You can't have it.

54
00:04:24,077 --> 00:04:25,077
I don't want it!

55
00:04:25,077 --> 00:04:30,077
It's time for round three, the Run Roll Around roller skating race.

56
00:04:30,077 --> 00:04:32,077
Say that three times fast.

57
00:04:32,077 --> 00:04:35,077
At any rate, it's a head-to-head race on an outdoor track.

58
00:04:35,077 --> 00:04:37,077
As always, the rules are simple.

59
00:04:37,077 --> 00:04:39,077
At the sound of the first whistle,

60
00:04:39,077 --> 00:04:42,077
each team's point-getter will start skating around the track.

61
00:04:42,077 --> 00:04:45,077
Twenty seconds later, the second whistle will blow

62
00:04:45,077 --> 00:04:47,077
and the team defenders will follow suit.

63
00:04:47,077 --> 00:04:49,077
The defenders can try to hinder the opposing team

64
00:04:49,077 --> 00:04:51,077
or support their point-getter.

65
00:04:51,077 --> 00:04:52,077
Anything goes.

66
00:04:52,077 --> 00:04:55,077
Assuming that the point-getters aren't injured or disqualified,

67
00:04:55,077 --> 00:04:58,077
the race will continue for five minutes.

68
00:04:58,077 --> 00:04:59,077
At the end of that time,

69
00:04:59,077 --> 00:05:02,077
the team whose point-getter is in the league wins.

70
00:05:02,077 --> 00:05:05,077
So as little as an inch can mean victory or defeat.

71
00:05:05,077 --> 00:05:07,077
Naturally, yours truly will be providing the play-by-play

72
00:05:07,077 --> 00:05:09,077
from my special bird's nest view

73
00:05:09,077 --> 00:05:11,077
right next to the starting line.

74
00:05:11,077 --> 00:05:16,077
Now it's time for our two talented teams to take the track.

75
00:05:16,077 --> 00:05:18,077
All right, guys.

76
00:05:18,077 --> 00:05:20,077
No matter how bad they cheat,

77
00:05:20,077 --> 00:05:22,077
we gotta get Chopper back this time.

78
00:05:22,077 --> 00:05:23,077
You ready?

79
00:05:23,077 --> 00:05:24,077
Yeah!

80
00:05:24,077 --> 00:05:25,077
Whoa!

81
00:05:25,077 --> 00:05:28,077
And here come the Straw Hat dangers,

82
00:05:28,077 --> 00:05:31,077
making a grand entrance with a roaring battle cry.

83
00:05:36,077 --> 00:05:38,077
And on this end,

84
00:05:38,077 --> 00:05:39,077
their all-powerful opponents,

85
00:05:39,077 --> 00:05:42,077
the indomitable Foxy Devils!

86
00:05:42,077 --> 00:05:45,077
Roostop is the team's playmaker, Porkchop!

87
00:05:45,077 --> 00:05:48,077
Next is the stunningly speedy Cheetah!

88
00:05:48,077 --> 00:05:50,077
The defensive dynamo, Mashikaku!

89
00:05:50,077 --> 00:05:52,077
The fighting fishman, Jube!

90
00:05:52,077 --> 00:05:53,077
And Girarin!

91
00:05:53,077 --> 00:05:54,077
Oh!

92
00:05:54,077 --> 00:05:55,077
And last but not least,

93
00:05:55,077 --> 00:05:57,077
we have Foxy as the head coach

94
00:05:57,077 --> 00:05:59,077
and Hamburg as the team manager!

95
00:05:59,077 --> 00:06:01,077
That's a mighty line-up if I've ever seen one!

96
00:06:01,077 --> 00:06:14,077
Hey, what are you doing?

97
00:06:14,077 --> 00:06:15,077
Whoa!

98
00:06:15,077 --> 00:06:16,077
What is Chicky Cheetah up to?

99
00:06:16,077 --> 00:06:19,077
Is he intimidating Luffy before the start of the match?

100
00:06:21,077 --> 00:06:22,077
What's with this weirdo?

101
00:06:22,077 --> 00:06:23,077
He's kind of creeping me out.

102
00:06:23,077 --> 00:06:26,077
Fee-fee-fee-fee-fee-fee-fee-fee-fee-fee-fee-fee-fee!

103
00:06:26,077 --> 00:06:28,077
His feet are indeed a thing of wonder,

104
00:06:28,077 --> 00:06:30,077
but his nose is impressive too!

105
00:06:30,077 --> 00:06:32,077
You ate something pungent, didn't you?

106
00:06:34,077 --> 00:06:36,077
Uh-oh, Luffy, he's onto you!

107
00:06:36,077 --> 00:06:38,077
That's what you get for eating that old man's cheese!

108
00:06:38,077 --> 00:06:40,077
Oh, is that why?

109
00:06:40,077 --> 00:06:41,077
That was a joke!

110
00:06:44,077 --> 00:06:45,077
Jeez!

111
00:06:45,077 --> 00:06:46,077
Lots of manners, will ya?

112
00:06:46,077 --> 00:06:47,077
Shoo! Shoo!

113
00:06:51,077 --> 00:06:52,077
Wow!

114
00:06:52,077 --> 00:06:53,077
Okay!

115
00:06:53,077 --> 00:06:54,077
I don't know what that was about!

116
00:06:54,077 --> 00:06:56,077
But anyway, now that that's done with,

117
00:06:56,077 --> 00:06:58,077
let's get back to the rules!

118
00:06:58,077 --> 00:07:00,077
In addition to the defenders and point-getters,

119
00:07:00,077 --> 00:07:02,077
each team also has a coach and a manager,

120
00:07:02,077 --> 00:07:03,077
but unlike the other players,

121
00:07:03,077 --> 00:07:05,077
they're limited to the sidelines!

122
00:07:05,077 --> 00:07:07,077
The teams must change point-getters every round,

123
00:07:07,077 --> 00:07:10,077
and each player can only be point-getter once!

124
00:07:10,077 --> 00:07:11,077
But wait!

125
00:07:11,077 --> 00:07:13,077
Since the manager and coach can't play,

126
00:07:13,077 --> 00:07:15,077
that means you need at least seven members,

127
00:07:15,077 --> 00:07:17,077
which makes the Straw Hats one man short!

128
00:07:17,077 --> 00:07:19,077
Whatever shall they do?

129
00:07:19,077 --> 00:07:20,077
That's a shame!

130
00:07:20,077 --> 00:07:23,077
But hey, since I'm such a generous guy,

131
00:07:23,077 --> 00:07:26,077
I'll let one of you sorry saps be the point-getter twice!

132
00:07:26,077 --> 00:07:28,077
If your pride will allow it, of course.

133
00:07:28,077 --> 00:07:29,077
Fefefefefefefe!

134
00:07:29,077 --> 00:07:31,077
I've had about enough of that laugh!

135
00:07:31,077 --> 00:07:32,077
We love you, boss!

136
00:07:32,077 --> 00:07:33,077
You're the best!

137
00:07:33,077 --> 00:07:34,077
So kind!

138
00:07:34,077 --> 00:07:36,077
The generosity has moved me to tears!

139
00:07:36,077 --> 00:07:38,077
You're a real man!

140
00:07:38,077 --> 00:07:42,077
You guys!

141
00:07:42,077 --> 00:07:45,077
Can you believe this guy? He's actually taking this crap seriously.

142
00:07:45,077 --> 00:07:47,077
Anything to feed his ego, right?

143
00:07:47,077 --> 00:07:50,077
We gotta hurry up and put this guy out of his misery.

144
00:07:50,077 --> 00:07:53,077
Oh, no! Don't sink, boss! We need you!

145
00:07:53,077 --> 00:07:58,077
But, annoying as he is, we kinda have to take him up on his offer, right?

146
00:07:58,077 --> 00:08:02,077
Hey, as long as it helps us beat him faster, I'm not complaining.

147
00:08:02,077 --> 00:08:06,077
We're fighting for Chopper's sake. This is no time to get hung up on pride.

148
00:08:08,077 --> 00:08:14,077
You're on, Splithead. We've got ourselves a match now. Get ready.

149
00:08:14,077 --> 00:08:20,077
You're too naive, boy. Do you want to know why I made you an offer that puts me at a disadvantage?

150
00:08:20,077 --> 00:08:22,077
Simple.

151
00:08:22,077 --> 00:08:23,077
Cause we're awesome!

152
00:08:23,077 --> 00:08:26,077
Alright! Let's get Chopper's sake!

153
00:08:26,077 --> 00:08:28,077
Yeah!

154
00:08:28,077 --> 00:08:30,077
Boss, no!

155
00:08:30,077 --> 00:08:34,077
And there you have it! Both captains have agreed to amend the rules!

156
00:08:34,077 --> 00:08:38,077
As soon as the Straw Hat Rangers select a point-getter for each round, we can begin!

157
00:08:38,077 --> 00:08:45,077
Alright. Since we've got five rounds, our best bet is to put our strongest scores in rounds one, three, and five.

158
00:08:45,077 --> 00:08:47,077
Question is, who do we want to start out with?

159
00:08:47,077 --> 00:08:49,077
Put me in two rounds, okay? Please? Please?

160
00:08:49,077 --> 00:08:52,077
I'll think about it if you shut up and leave me alone for a sec!

161
00:08:52,077 --> 00:08:58,077
Since he's so full of energy, I'll put Luffy as point-getter in round one, then again in round five.

162
00:08:58,077 --> 00:09:00,077
Yeah!

163
00:09:00,077 --> 00:09:04,077
I probably shouldn't expect much from Nami and Usopp.

164
00:09:04,077 --> 00:09:09,077
Hey, Robin. Looks like it's best to put you in round three. That okay?

165
00:09:09,077 --> 00:09:12,077
Sure. You seem to understand this better than anyone else.

166
00:09:12,077 --> 00:09:16,077
Thank you. But wait, what if the other team has the same idea?

167
00:09:16,077 --> 00:09:18,077
Okay, new plan.

168
00:09:18,077 --> 00:09:20,077
Okay, come on! Hurry up!

169
00:09:20,077 --> 00:09:22,077
Alright, I'm done!

170
00:09:22,077 --> 00:09:28,077
Luffy has rounds one and five, Nami has two, Usopp has three, and Robin has been moved to four.

171
00:09:28,077 --> 00:09:32,077
Hey, hold on a sec. Why do you get to make all these big decisions without asking me?

172
00:09:32,077 --> 00:09:33,077
Huh?

173
00:09:33,077 --> 00:09:36,077
Cause the coach makes all the decisions, not the manager. And I'm the coach.

174
00:09:36,077 --> 00:09:40,077
And why do you get to have the awesome job while I get stuck following your stupid orders?

175
00:09:40,077 --> 00:09:45,077
Obviously, because I'm a genius and your brain is so rotten you're growing mold on your head.

176
00:09:45,077 --> 00:09:49,077
If you think you're a genius, then your ego is as twisted as your eyebrows.

177
00:09:49,077 --> 00:09:50,077
Why?

178
00:09:50,077 --> 00:09:54,077
By the way, there's one more very important rule we need to...

179
00:09:54,077 --> 00:09:57,077
Knock it off! I can't heal him!

180
00:09:57,077 --> 00:10:01,077
If any of the racers go and traverse or leave the course for whatever reason,

181
00:10:01,077 --> 00:10:04,077
they will be immediately disqualified from the game.

182
00:10:04,077 --> 00:10:07,077
Starting before the whistle means disqualification as well.

183
00:10:10,077 --> 00:10:14,077
Okay, looks like everything is finally set in the first round.

184
00:10:14,077 --> 00:10:19,077
Oh, coming on strong from the start, it's Straw Hat Movie versus our very own Porcha!

185
00:10:19,077 --> 00:10:24,077
The anticipation is killing me! So without further ado, let's get this thing started!

186
00:10:24,077 --> 00:10:26,077
Man, talk about exciting!

187
00:10:26,077 --> 00:10:28,077
No kidding, this is my favorite event!

188
00:10:28,077 --> 00:10:29,077
Yeah, mine too!

189
00:10:29,077 --> 00:10:33,077
Go Porcha! Beat that rubber dude's sense lift!

190
00:10:33,077 --> 00:10:34,077
Huh?

191
00:10:34,077 --> 00:10:36,077
Ha-ha-ha! Hey, look!

192
00:10:36,077 --> 00:10:38,077
Ha-ha-ha! You're kidding me! The way...

193
00:10:38,077 --> 00:10:39,077
Ha-ha-ha-ha!

194
00:10:39,077 --> 00:10:40,077
Whoa! This is kinda hard!

195
00:10:40,077 --> 00:10:42,077
Uh-uh-uh-uh! Please somebody tell me I'm seeing things!

196
00:10:42,077 --> 00:10:43,077
No! Don't make me look! I'm scared! Make it go away!

197
00:10:43,077 --> 00:10:44,077
Ha-ha-uh-uhhh!

198
00:10:44,077 --> 00:10:45,077
Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

199
00:10:45,077 --> 00:10:46,077
Ha-ha-ha-ha!

200
00:10:46,077 --> 00:10:47,077
Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

201
00:10:47,077 --> 00:10:48,077
Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

202
00:10:48,077 --> 00:10:51,077
Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

203
00:10:51,077 --> 00:10:52,077
Ah!

204
00:10:52,077 --> 00:10:53,077
Ha-ha-ha!

205
00:10:53,077 --> 00:10:54,077
Ooh!

206
00:10:54,077 --> 00:10:56,077
Please, somebody tell me I'm seeing things!

207
00:10:56,077 --> 00:10:58,077
No! Don't make me look! I'm scared! Make it go away!

208
00:11:01,077 --> 00:11:06,077
Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

209
00:11:06,077 --> 00:11:08,537
Infected? Straw Hat doesn't know how to skate!

210
00:11:09,397 --> 00:11:13,077
And according to the roster, he's scheduled to play Port Kidder in two rounds.

211
00:11:13,397 --> 00:11:15,337
Is the game over before it's even started?

212
00:11:15,917 --> 00:11:19,777
Hey, you can race as many times as you like, kid!

213
00:11:20,977 --> 00:11:22,137
Come on.

214
00:11:26,717 --> 00:11:28,077
Now what are we gonna do?

215
00:11:28,497 --> 00:11:33,757
Wait a second. If we can't count on Luffy, then that means everyone's gonna expect me to win the third round!

216
00:11:36,077 --> 00:11:36,577
Ah!

217
00:12:00,257 --> 00:12:05,557
Both teams have finally made it to the starting line, but I'm beginning to wonder if this is going to be much of a race.

218
00:12:05,557 --> 00:12:07,797
At any rate, let's see what happens, Howie.

219
00:12:08,277 --> 00:12:11,237
Why'd you ask to be in two rounds if you don't even know how to skate?

220
00:12:11,557 --> 00:12:15,357
It's not my fault. That was before I found out that skating is the hardest thing in the world.

221
00:12:17,277 --> 00:12:19,417
We're doomed. It's all over now.

222
00:12:19,617 --> 00:12:22,557
Don't give up just yet. It's our job to pick up the slack.

223
00:12:23,217 --> 00:12:26,077
Come on, guys. Let's go. Quick Air is to the track.

224
00:12:26,337 --> 00:12:28,077
What? Not you again.

225
00:12:28,077 --> 00:12:30,797
If you pull any more stunts, you're getting a boot to the face.

226
00:12:33,757 --> 00:12:37,677
We don't need stunts this time. We can beat you with both hands tied behind our back.

227
00:12:39,277 --> 00:12:42,557
It's time for the third game, the Run Roll Around.

228
00:12:42,557 --> 00:12:48,637
Will Portia breeze through to an easy victory, or will the rookie skater's straw hat make a miraculous improvement?

229
00:12:50,077 --> 00:12:52,637
On your marks, get set.

230
00:12:56,637 --> 00:13:00,457
And she's off! Portia tears down the track with spectacular speed!

231
00:13:00,457 --> 00:13:03,197
Now let's check in on our challenger, Loafy!

232
00:13:04,197 --> 00:13:07,957
He's flat on his face! He didn't even make it across the starting line!

233
00:13:09,377 --> 00:13:11,117
Certainly is hard-headed, isn't it?

234
00:13:12,257 --> 00:13:13,177
Stupid shoes!

235
00:13:13,217 --> 00:13:16,497
Hold now! Removing your skates will result in instant disqualification!

236
00:13:17,497 --> 00:13:17,977
Right!

237
00:13:21,197 --> 00:13:23,497
If I make it over there, I can grab the rail!

238
00:13:27,337 --> 00:13:29,077
Well, not much of a race!

239
00:13:30,457 --> 00:13:32,457
20 seconds have passed!

240
00:13:32,457 --> 00:13:34,777
It's time to let the defenders loose!

241
00:13:35,397 --> 00:13:37,957
I see Gokko!

242
00:13:38,657 --> 00:13:41,217
Hey! He's about to get pinned! Somebody help him!

243
00:13:41,237 --> 00:13:42,017
Not me!

244
00:13:47,457 --> 00:13:49,257
Well, that's weird.

245
00:13:53,537 --> 00:13:54,977
Gum-Gum Balloon?

246
00:13:55,537 --> 00:13:57,357
That's it! Let's go, Usopp!

247
00:13:57,637 --> 00:13:58,037
What?

248
00:13:59,397 --> 00:14:00,037
Hey!

249
00:14:00,457 --> 00:14:02,457
Listen, Loopy, you have to keep holding your breath!

250
00:14:02,457 --> 00:14:04,457
We're gonna roll you all the way around the track!

251
00:14:05,457 --> 00:14:06,457
Whatever works!

252
00:14:07,457 --> 00:14:09,457
Cien fleurs, Delphinius!

253
00:14:09,457 --> 00:14:10,457
Huh?

254
00:14:14,457 --> 00:14:15,457
Wow! Thanks, Robin!

255
00:14:15,457 --> 00:14:16,457
She's rolling it with her arms!

256
00:14:16,457 --> 00:14:17,457
Awesome!

257
00:14:17,457 --> 00:14:18,457
What incredible speed!

